والمستثنى مسمًّى بأعيانه ومقيسٌ ببصماته في `RUKHSA.md`، ويصادمُه
`python rukhsa_check.py --check`.

This license covers only what this project authored. Bytes it does not own are
excluded; each exclusion is named and fingerprint-measured in `RUKHSA.md` and
collided by `python rukhsa_check.py --check`.

